gantt
    title First live wage month against the dated events of Tax Year 2026-27 and after
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    axisFormat %b %y

    section Candidate first live wage month
    Before the cliff - wage month Oct 2026          :w1, 2026-10-01, 2026-10-31
    Straddle month - Nov 2026                        :crit, w2, 2026-11-01, 2026-11-30
    Post-cliff and Q3 part-prior - Dec 2026          :w3, 2026-12-01, 2026-12-31
    First quarter is the fenced Q4 - Jan to Mar 2027 :crit, w4, 2027-01-01, 2027-03-31
    Clean tax-year cutover - Apr 2027                :active, w5, 2027-04-01, 2027-04-30
    DPDP switch in first cycles - May to Jun 2027    :w6, 2027-05-01, 2027-06-30

    section Statutory dates
    ESI saving lapses on or about 21 Nov 2026        :crit, milestone, esi, 2026-11-21, 0d
    Form 138 Q3 due 31 Jan 2027                      :milestone, q3, 2027-01-31, 0d
    FORM-XVII and Form XXIII due end Feb 2027        :milestone, ann, 2027-02-28, 0d
    Finance Act effective 1 Apr 2027                 :milestone, fin, 2027-04-01, 0d
    Form 138 Q4 due 31 May 2027 - format fenced      :crit, milestone, q4, 2027-05-31, 0d
    Form 130 due 15 Jun 2027 - fenced on Q4          :crit, milestone, f130, 2027-06-15, 0d
    Form 138 Q1 of Tax Year 2027-28 due 31 Jul 2027  :milestone, q1n, 2027-07-31, 0d

    section External dated events
    WABA INR billing deadline 31 Dec 2026            :milestone, waba, 2026-12-31, 0d
    Gemini 3.x Flash price doubles 1 Jan 2027        :milestone, gem, 2027-01-01, 0d
    DPDP substantive provisions on or about 13 May 2027 :milestone, dpdp, 2027-05-13, 0d
